{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>金力集團擬進行2供1，供股集資逾1,300萬元。</p><p></p><p>每股供股價0.6元，較上日收市價折讓逾一成四，涉及發行逾2,268萬股供股份。集資所得主要用於償還銀行貸款，餘額用作一般營運資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T00:59:12.022655+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T02:57:41.048405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T00:57:37.223421+00:00","content_hash":"6fda006883dcec0e8e8780de410421ddfc343adf6d4529a12988edd6b9426779","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}